  CellName: Scarab Scramble
  Description: Hoop-court party cell. The nucleus IS the sphere court (play geometry,
    not a claim - the controller clears NucleusIsControlZone) and the mass is Scarab
    trail plus switch bricks, grazed by a small cleanup crew that waits outside the
    court until the volume ladder leaves Calm. Thresholds are authored for SCARAB
    trail volume (10 at rest to 40 skim-grown per prism, one per spawn) with NO
    structural floor - there is no super-shielded lining in this arena, so do not
    copy the Astro League ladder, which rides a 30k lining floor. ESTIMATE pending
    the in-editor baseline measure; see SCARABSCRAMBLE.md.
